      <p class="text-sm text-ink/60 mb-6">Per PACKAGING.md §9, we're using a 13 × 48 mm vertical strip across the cap-to-glass joint — a printed sticker, not shrink film. That makes it an ordinary label job, and it needs no heat gun.</p>

